      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A cascade approach has been developed towards dual C-C bond formation via consecutive C-H functionalization/cyclization giving access to pyrrolo[1,2-a]indoles in a highly regio- and diastereoselective manner using catalytic [Ru(p-cymene)Cl2]2. The methodology was further expanded to attain pentacyclic structures involving manifold C-C bond creation."},
